SUMMARY:Square Dance with Ox on Fire and Squirrel Butter: A Fundraiser for the Lotus Match Campaign
DESCRIPTION:Admission will be $5-$15\, sliding scale – and remember\, every dollar will be matched.\nTo kick off the Lotus Match campaign\, Lotus will be hosting a square dance at the Lotus Firebay on Friday\, July 31\, 7:30 – 9:30 PM. We’ll have two bands and two callers interwoven throughout the night\, mixing and matching being the theme of the night. \nOur bands will be local favorites Ox on Fire and Indianapolis favorites Squirrel Butter. Both bands bring a caller in the mix\, featuring Tamara Loewenthal and Charmaine Slaven. \n  \nSquirrel Butter
URL:https://www.lotusfest.org/event/square-dance-with-ox-on-fire-and-squirrel-butter/
LOCATION:Lotus Firebay\, 105 S Rogers Street\, Bloomington\, IN\, 47404\, United States
CATEGORIES:Lotus Event
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://www.lotusfest.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/oxonfire.webp
END:VEVENT
